endobj

363 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/T(The highly competitive Indian OTT market drives platforms to constantly innovate their models. Most rely on ad revenue, as only a small fraction of users pay for subscriptions. Spotify India being a key example.  Platforms like JioHotstar attract mass audiences through affordable mobile plans and telecom bundles \(Reliance- the biggest telecom service provider\). Meanwhile, Amazon Primevideo leverages its e-commerce ecosystem, offering faster deliveries and a low-cost subscription that strongly appeals to India\220s youth dominated viewership \(GenZ\220s, &  Millenials\).)/E(The highly competitive Indian OTT market drives platforms to constantly innovate their models. Most rely on ad revenue, as only a small fraction of users pay for subscriptions. Spotify India being a key example.  Platforms like JioHotstar attract mass audiences through affordable mobile plans and telecom bundles \(Reliance- the biggest telecom service provider\). Meanwhile, Amazon Primevideo leverages its e-commerce ecosystem, offering faster deliveries and a low-cost subscription that strongly appeals to India\220s youth dominated viewership \(GenZ\220s, &  Millenials\).)/Pg 11 0 R/K[21 22 23]>>
endobj

364 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/T(AGGRESSIVE COMPETITION            )/E(AGGRESSIVE COMPETITION            )/Pg 11 0 R/K[24]>>
endobj

365 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/T(Although data costs in India are among the lowest in the world, the cost of subscription video-on-demand \(SVoD\) services can still be a barrier for many price-sensitive consumers. The "digital divide," exists between varying income levels, and less per capita income.)/E(Although data costs in India are among the lowest in the world, the cost of subscription video-on-demand \(SVoD\) services can still be a barrier for many price-sensitive consumers. The "digital divide," exists between varying income levels, and less per capita income.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[25]>>
endobj

366 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/T(AFFORDABILITY                            )/E(AFFORDABILITY                            )/Pg 11 0 R/K[26]>>
